# 强制跨平台换行符规范：所有脚本与代码文件在任意操作系统检出时均使用 LF 换行符
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.lock text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# 纯二进制文件禁止任何换行符转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
*.gguf binary
*.onnx binary
*.deb binary
*.zip binary
*.tar.gz binary
*.so binary
*.so.* binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.bin binary
